 6 and 8 (azithromycin, clarithromycin, erythromycin, roxithromycin)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Decreased TNF&#x003b1; (azithromycin, clarithromycin, erythromycin, roxithromycin)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Decreased granulocyte/monocyte colony-stimulating factor (clarithromycin)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Decreased monocyte chemotactic protein 1 (azithromycin)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Decreased E-selectin (azithromycin)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Decreased CRP (roxithromycin)</td></tr></table></table-wrap></floats-group></article>